<section id="privacy">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p><b>This site</b> has no analytics, no cookies, and loads nothing from other sites. Requests aren't logged, so your IP address isn't kept. Downloads come from GitHub.</p>
    <p><b>The app</b> talks to your provider, and to the optional services you turn on (guide sources, TMDB, SubDL). Your sources, logins and history stay on your computer. The full list is in the <a href="https://github.com/thesubtleties/sbtlTV#privacy">README</a>.</p>
    <p><b>Curated lists</b> are one file the app checks about once a day: no account, no ID, nothing about you in the request. Like the rest of the site, it isn't logged. Turn lists off in the app and it is never fetched.</p>
  </div>
</section>
